"Hyrox Sim": "Hyrox sim",
"Hyrox Sim ist heute. Kraft diese Woche am besten nur kurz und leicht. Ein lockeres Training reicht, die übrigen kannst du auslassen.": "Hyrox Sim is today. Keep strength training short and light this week. One easy workout is enough, you can skip the others.",
"Hyrox Sim. Viel Erfolg": "Hyrox sim. Good luck",
"Hyrox-Einheiten pro Woche": "Hyrox sessions per week",
"Hyrox-Station {0}: {1} Wdh. Frauen {2} kg auf {3} m (Pro {4} kg), Männer {5} kg auf {6} m (Pro {7} kg).": "Hyrox station {0}: {1} reps. Women {2} kg to {3} m (Pro {4} kg), men {5} kg to {6} m (Pro {7} kg).",
"Hyrox-Station {0}: {1} m am Seil. Gewicht inkl. Schlitten: Frauen {2} kg (Pro {3} kg), Männer {4} kg (Pro {5} kg).": "Hyrox station {0}: {1} m on the rope. Weight incl. sled: women {2} kg (Pro {3} kg), men {4} kg (Pro {5} kg).",
"Hyrox-Station {0}: {1} m mit dem Sandsack auf den Schultern, hinteres Knie berührt jedes Mal den Boden. Frauen {2} kg (Pro {3} kg), Männer {4} kg (Pro {5} kg).": "Hyrox station {0}: {1} m with the sandbag on the shoulders, the back knee touches the floor every time. Women {2} kg (Pro {3} kg), men {4} kg (Pro {5} kg).",
